        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Rhodesia, Zimbabwe, Zambia, Zambezi River\n- Topics: British protectorates, national borders, country formation\n\nFacts:\n- Rhodesia was a former British protectorate.\n- Rhodesia later became two countries: Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- The Zambezi River forms the border between Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- Zimbabwe lies south of the Zambezi River.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.",
